      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef solve():\n    # Read input\n    H, W = map(int, input().split())\n    grid = []\n    for _ in range(H):\n        grid.append(input().strip())\n    \n    # Directions for up, down, left, right\n    directions = [(-1, 0), (1, 0), (0, -1), (0, 1)]\n    \n    # Precompute which cells are movable (not adjacent to any magnet)\n    movable = [[True] * W for _ in range(H)]\n    magnets = []\n    \n    # Find all magnets and mark adjacent cells as non-movable\n    for i in range(H):\n        for j in range(W):\n            if grid[i][j] == '#':\n                magnets.append((i, j))\n                # Mark all adjacent cells as non-movable\n                for di, dj in directions:\n                    ni, nj = i + di, j + dj\n                    if 0 <= ni < H and 0 <= nj < W:\n                        movable[ni][nj] = False\n    \n    # For cells with magnets, they are not part of any path\n    for i in range(H):\n        for j in range(W):\n            if grid[i][j] == '#':\n                movable[i][j] = False\n    \n    # Now find connected components in the movable cells\n    visited = [[False] * W for _ in range(H)]\n    max_degree = 0\n    \n    for i in range(H):\n        for j in range(W):\n            if movable[i][j] and not visited[i][j]:\n                # BFS to find size of connected component\n                component_size = 0\n                queue = deque([(i, j)])\n                visited[i][j] = True\n                \n                while queue:\n                    ci, cj = queue.popleft()\n                    component_size += 1\n                    \n                    for di, dj in directions:\n                        ni, nj = ci + di, cj + dj\n                        if (0 <= ni < H and 0 <= nj < W and \n                            movable[ni][nj] and not visited[ni][nj]):\n                            visited[ni][nj] = True\n                            queue.append((ni, nj))\n                \n                max_degree = max(max_degree, component_size)\n    \n    print(max_degree)\n\nsolve()\n```",
