    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    \n    # Read input\n    N, K = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n    A = list(map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split()))\n    \n    # Initialize variables\n    empty_seats = K\n    starts = 0\n    \n    for i in range(N):\n        # If current group cannot fit in remaining seats, start the attraction\n        if A[i] > empty_seats:\n            starts += 1\n            empty_seats = K  # Reset empty seats after starting\n        \n        # Guide the current group to the attraction\n        empty_seats -= A[i]\n    \n    # If there are any people in the attraction, we need to start it one last time\n    if empty_seats < K:\n        starts += 1\n    \n    print(starts)\n\nsolve()\n```",
