    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    # Read input\n    N = int(input())\n    A = list(map(int, input().split()))\n    Q = int(input())\n    \n    # Extract sleep sessions: (start, end) for each sleep period\n    sleep_sessions = []\n    for i in range(1, N, 2):\n        if i + 1 < N:\n            start = A[i]     # fell asleep\n            end = A[i + 1]   # woke up\n            sleep_sessions.append((start, end))\n    \n    # Process each query\n    for _ in range(Q):\n        l, r = map(int, input().split())\n        total_sleep = 0\n        \n        for start, end in sleep_sessions:\n            # Find intersection of [start, end] with [l, r]\n            intersect_start = max(start, l)\n            intersect_end = min(end, r)\n            \n            # If there's an overlap\n            if intersect_start < intersect_end:\n                total_sleep += intersect_end - intersect_start\n                \n        print(total_sleep)\n\nsolve()\n```",
