    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef longestValidSubstring(word, forbidden):\n    forbidden_set = set(forbidden)\n    n = len(word)\n    max_length = 0\n    \n    # For each starting position\n    for i in range(n):\n        # Expand ending position\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # Check if current substring contains any forbidden substring\n            valid = True\n            # Check all possible substrings of the current substring\n            for forbidden_str in forbidden_set:\n                if forbidden_str in word[i:j+1]:\n                    valid = False\n                    break\n            \n            if valid:\n                max_length = max(max_length, j - i + 1)\n            else:\n                # If current substring is invalid, any longer substring starting at i will also be invalid\n                break\n    \n    return max_length\n```",
