      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimumDistance(points):\n    def manhattan_distance(p1, p2):\n        return abs(p1[0] - p2[0]) + abs(p1[1] - p2[1])\n    \n    n = len(points)\n    min_max_distance = float('inf')\n    \n    # Try removing each point\n    for i in range(n):\n        # Create a list without the i-th point\n        remaining_points = points[:i] + points[i+1:]\n        \n        # Find maximum distance between any two remaining points\n        max_distance = 0\n        for j in range(len(remaining_points)):\n            for k in range(j + 1, len(remaining_points)):\n                dist = manhattan_distance(remaining_points[j], remaining_points[k])\n                max_distance = max(max_distance, dist)\n        \n        # Update minimum of maximum distances\n        min_max_distance = min(min_max_distance, max_distance)\n    \n    return min_max_distance\n```",
