      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef removeAlmostEqualCharacters(word):\n    n = len(word)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return 0\n    \n    operations = 0\n    i = 1\n    \n    while i < n:\n        # Check if current character is almost equal to previous character\n        prev_char = word[i-1]\n        curr_char = word[i]\n        \n        # Characters are almost equal if they are the same or adjacent in alphabet\n        if prev_char == curr_char or abs(ord(prev_char) - ord(curr_char)) == 1:\n            operations += 1\n            # Skip the next character since we've handled this pair\n            i += 2\n        else:\n            i += 1\n    \n    return operations\n```",
