      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    S = input().strip()\n    \n    # Find the first non-A character\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(S) and S[i] == 'A':\n        i += 1\n    \n    # Find the first non-B character after the A's\n    j = i\n    while j < len(S) and S[j] == 'B':\n        j += 1\n    \n    # Check if the rest are all C's\n    k = j\n    while k < len(S) and S[k] == 'C':\n        k += 1\n    \n    # If we've processed all characters and the pattern is correct\n    if k == len(S):\n        print(\"Yes\")\n    else:\n        print(\"No\")\n\nsolve()\n```",
