    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef sumImbalanceNumbers(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    total_imbalance = 0\n    \n    # Iterate through all possible subarrays\n    for i in range(n):\n        # Use a set to store elements in current subarray\n        subarray_set = set()\n        \n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # Add current element to the set\n            subarray_set.add(nums[j])\n            \n            # Convert set to sorted list to calculate imbalance\n            sorted_subarray = sorted(subarray_set)\n            imbalance = 0\n            \n            # Count the number of positions where difference > 1\n            for k in range(len(sorted_subarray) - 1):\n                if sorted_subarray[k + 1] - sorted_subarray[k] > 1:\n                    imbalance += 1\n            \n            total_imbalance += imbalance\n    \n    return total_imbalance\n```",
