      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef findPrimePairs(n):\n    def is_prime(num):\n        if num < 2:\n            return False\n        if num == 2:\n            return True\n        if num % 2 == 0:\n            return False\n        for i in range(3, int(num ** 0.5) + 1, 2):\n            if num % i == 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n    \n    # Generate all primes up to n\n    primes = []\n    for i in range(2, n + 1):\n        if is_prime(i):\n            primes.append(i)\n    \n    prime_set = set(primes)\n    result = []\n    \n    for x in primes:\n        y = n - x\n        if x <= y and y in prime_set:\n            result.append([x, y])\n    \n    return result\n```",
