    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef min_length(s: str) -> int:\n    n = len(s)\n    # collect all divisors of n, sorted ascending\n    divs = []\n    for i in range(1, int(n ** 0.5) + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            divs.append(i)\n            if i != n // i:\n                divs.append(n // i)\n    divs.sort()\n    # test each divisor\n    for L in divs:\n        # base frequency of first block\n        base = [0] * 26\n        for ch in s[:L]:\n            base[ord(ch) - 97] += 1\n        ok = True\n        for start in range(L, n, L):\n            cur = [0] * 26\n            for ch in s[start:start + L]:\n                cur[ord(ch) - 97] += 1\n            if cur != base:\n                ok = False\n                break\n        if ok:\n            return L\n    # fallback (should never be reached)\n    return n\n```",
