      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maximumStrongPairXor(nums):\n    max_xor = 0\n    \n    # Check all possible pairs (including same element twice)\n    for i in range(len(nums)):\n        for j in range(len(nums)):\n            x, y = nums[i], nums[j]\n            \n            # Check if the pair is a strong pair\n            if abs(x - y) <= min(x, y):\n                # Calculate XOR and update maximum\n                max_xor = max(max_xor, x ^ y)\n    \n    return max_xor\n```",
