t the moment we want to apply the i^th move.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef relocateMarbles(nums, moveFrom, moveTo):\n    # Use a set to track occupied positions\n    positions = set(nums)\n    \n    # Process each move\n    for i in range(len(moveFrom)):\n        from_pos = moveFrom[i]\n        to_pos = moveTo[i]\n        \n        # If there are marbles at the from position, move them\n        if from_pos in positions:\n            positions.remove(from_pos)\n            positions.add(to_pos)\n    \n    # Return sorted list of occupied positions\n    return sorted(list(positions))\n```",
