      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef alternatingSubarray(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    max_length = -1\n    \n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        if nums[i + 1] != nums[i] + 1:\n            continue\n            \n        # Found potential start of alternating subarray\n        length = 2\n        max_length = max(max_length, length)\n        \n        # Extend the subarray as long as the alternating pattern holds\n        for j in range(i + 2, n):\n            expected_diff = (-1) ** (j - i)\n            if nums[j] - nums[j - 1] == expected_diff:\n                length += 1\n                max_length = max(max_length, length)\n            else:\n                break\n    \n    return max_length\n```",
