      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef solve():\n    H, W, K = map(int, input().split())\n    grid = []\n    for _ in range(H):\n        grid.append(input().strip())\n    \n    # If K is 1, we just need one 'o' or one '.' that we can convert\n    if K == 1:\n        for i in range(H):\n            for j in range(W):\n                if grid[i][j] == 'o' or grid[i][j] == '.':\n                    print(0)\n                    return\n        print(-1)\n        return\n    \n    min_ops = float('inf')\n    found = False\n    \n    # Check horizontal sequences\n    if K <= W:\n        for i in range(H):\n            for j in range(W - K + 1):\n                # Check if we can form K consecutive 'o's starting at (i, j)\n                ops_needed = 0\n                valid = True\n                for k in range(K):\n                    cell = grid[i][j + k]\n                    if cell == 'x':\n                        valid = False\n                        break\n                    elif cell == '.':\n                        ops_needed += 1\n                \n                if valid:\n                    found = True\n                    min_ops = min(min_ops, ops_needed)\n    \n    # Check vertical sequences\n    if K <= H:\n        for j in range(W):\n            for i in range(H - K + 1):\n                # Check if we can form K consecutive 'o's starting at (i, j)\n                ops_needed = 0\n                valid = True\n                for k in range(K):\n                    cell = grid[i + k][j]\n                    if cell == 'x':\n                        valid = False\n                        break\n                    elif cell == '.':\n                        ops_needed += 1\n                \n                if valid:\n                    found = True\n                    min_ops = min(min_ops, ops_needed)\n    \n    if found:\n        print(min_ops)\n    else:\n        print(-1)\n\nsolve()\n```",
