      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef resultArray(nums):\n    arr1 = []  # Alice's removed elements\n    arr2 = []  # Bob's removed elements\n    temp_nums = nums.copy()\n    \n    # Sort the array to easily get minimum elements\n    temp_nums.sort()\n    \n    # Process in pairs since each round removes 2 elements\n    for i in range(0, len(temp_nums), 2):\n        # Alice removes the minimum (first element)\n        if i < len(temp_nums):\n            arr1.append(temp_nums[i])\n        # Bob removes the next minimum (second element)  \n        if i + 1 < len(temp_nums):\n            arr2.append(temp_nums[i + 1])\n    \n    # Bob appends first, then Alice - so reverse the order\n    result = []\n    for i in range(len(arr2)):\n        result.append(arr2[i])\n        result.append(arr1[i])\n    \n    return result\n```",
