      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    # Read input\n    N, X = map(int, input().split())\n    A = list(map(int, input().split()))\n    \n    # We have N-1 scores already, and we need to find the minimum score in round N\n    # such that the final grade (sum excluding min and max) is at least X\n    \n    min_score = float('inf')\n    \n    # Try all possible scores for round N (0 to 100)\n    for score_n in range(101):\n        # Create the full list of scores\n        scores = A + [score_n]\n        # Sort the scores\n        sorted_scores = sorted(scores)\n        \n        # Calculate final grade (sum excluding the lowest and highest)\n        # We remove one instance of min and one instance of max\n        final_grade = sum(sorted_scores) - sorted_scores[0] - sorted_scores[-1]\n        \n        # If this score gives us the required grade, update minimum\n        if final_grade >= X:\n            min_score = min(min_score, score_n)\n    \n    # If no valid score was found, return -1\n    if min_score == float('inf'):\n        print(-1)\n    else:\n        print(min_score)\n\nsolve()\n```",
