      "generated_answer": "```python\n\ndef countGoodPartitions(nums):\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    n = len(nums)\n    # last occurrence of each number\n    last = {}\n    for i, num in enumerate(nums):\n        last[num] = i\n    groups = 0\n    max_end = -1\n    for i, num in enumerate(nums):\n        max_end = max(max_end, last[num])\n        if i == max_end:\n            groups += 1\n    # number of ways = 2^(groups-1)\n    return pow(2, groups - 1, MOD)\n\n```",
