\n90\r\n80\r\n70\r\n60\n\nSample Input 3\n\n9 8\r\n8 8 2 2 8 8 2 2\n\nSample Output 3\n\n8\r\n8\r\n8\r\n2\r\n8\r\n8\r\n8\r\n2",
