    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}\n\nReporting the fraudulent activity is morally acceptable because it holds the son accountable for his actions and prevents him from continuing a pattern of criminal behavior that could lead to even more severe consequences. Failing to report the crime would enable his behavior and potentially make the parent complicit in the fraud.",
      "success": true,
