cause the political party has the right to choose its own members.\nI. deny relief, because the primary would be upheld by the Tenth Amendment.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
